  clock: 2  # 1249
  nonce: '1249'  # 1249
  message: "Post-ADR-0027 reframe (audit-findings 0013, fully landed): http_handler and http_route are no longer Symbol.kind values — the endpoint_shape section of SYMBOL_KINDS is empty. The kinds named in the original description (graphql_resolver, event_subscriber, mq_publisher, http_client) likewise no longer exist as kinds. Restated goal: the route-handler linker should emit Symbols with canonical kind=function|method plus meta['framework_role']='http_handler' (or 'http_route') for Apollo's http.createServer + startStandaloneServer codepath. The downstream routes.txt membership predicate is now meta['framework_role'] in {...} rather than kind in {...}. Note: the bakeoff observation cited (deep-20260510-054430) predates verification against the current registry; the actual count of relevant nodes should be re-derived from meta['framework_role'] when this item is picked up."  # 1249
